                "title": "Fiberglass Door Hinge",
                "description": "Sold and priced as a pair, these 4 inch security door hinges are made of steel. They have a 5/8 inch radius on one leaf and a square corner on the other. For use on Jeld-Wen doors and fiber glass doors that open outward where the hinge pins are outside the door. These extra security door hinges have a non-removable pin that prevents the hinge pin from being removed to allow the door to be pulled from the frame.",
